<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Code Solutions | Badge Earn</title>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="entire">
    <div class="badge">
      <h2>Hi, <%=UserName%>.</h2>
      <h4>Congratulations for progressing with code solutions</h4>
      <br>
      <img src="badge.png" alt="Badge Earn">
      <h3>You have earned Badge <%=BadgeName %></h3>
    </div>
    <div class="description">
      <p>
        Your participation and contributions to code solutions problem solving has earned you this presious badge.
        You can use this badge to get subscription advantages and access our advanced features. 
        <br>
        Good Luck <%= UserName%>, to your progress and future growth.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="regards">
      <h4>Regards</h4>
      <p>Code Solutions Team</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>